            <tr><td><code>role</code></td><td>VARCHAR(50)</td><td>DEFAULT 'pharmacist'</td><td>Chức vụ: <code>admin</code>, <code>pharmacist</code>, <code>warehouse</code></td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>status</code></td><td>VARCHAR(50)</td><td>DEFAULT 'active'</td><td>Trạng thái: <code>active</code> (Đang làm), <code>inactive</code> (Đã nghỉ)</td></tr>
